    "about.eyebrow": "Who we are",
    "about.title": "Neighbours who carry good news",
    "about.lead": "Florida Advent Missionaries is a lay Seventh-day Adventist missionary group. We are not paid pastors — we are teachers, nurses, drivers, students and grandparents who share the hope of Jesus in our own neighbourhoods, from Pensacola to Key West.",
